SUKA, SEIICHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN-ETSU HANDOTAI CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, KOUZOU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA YASUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OTSUKA SEIICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA KOUZOU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, YASUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OTSUKA, SEIICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, KOUZOU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A single-crystal pulling apparatus (1) according to the Czochralski technique comprises a main chamber (2), a pull chamber (3), a control deck (4) at a desired height adjacent to the main chamber (2) and the pull chamber (3), and a hand switch located on the control deck (4) to manipulate a remote controller (27) for controlling the vertical and rotational movements and withdraw of a single crystal. The single-crystal pulling apparatus (1) improves the safety of the workers on a catwalk around the apparatus and also improves the reliability of operation in consideration of the increasing weight and size of such apparatus.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un dispositif de tirage Czochralski de monocristal (1) qui comprend une chambre principale (2), une chambre de tirage (3), une plate-forme de commande (4), disposée à la hauteur requise contre la chambre principale (2) et la chambre de tirage (3), et un commutateur manuel (4) agissant sur un organe (27) qui commande les mouvements verticaux et de rotation ainsi que le retrait du monocristal. Le dispositif (1) de tirage de monocristal procure un surcroît de sécurité pour le personnel se trouvant sur la passerelle autour dudit dispositif ainsi qu'un fonctionnement plus sur compte tenu du poids et de la taille accrus de l'appareil.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>